{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-dns-architecture","title":"云 DNS 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/cloud-dns-architecture","wordCount":1594,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"云-dns-架构\">云 DNS 架构</h1><p>DNS 是网络的&quot;电话簿&quot;——它将人类可读的域名翻译为机器可路由的 IP 地址。在云环境中，DNS 不仅负责公有域名的外部解析，还承担 VPC 内部服务发现、跨 VPC 名称解析、以及混合环境的条件转发等关键职责。一个设计不当的 DNS 架构会导致服务不可达、故障切换延迟、甚至安全漏洞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>托管区（Hosted Zone / Managed Zone）</strong>：域名的 DNS 记录容器，分为公有（互联网可见）和私有（仅 VPC 内可见）两种</li>\n<li><strong>Private Hosted Zone（PHZ）</strong>：仅对关联 VPC 可见的 DNS 区域，支持覆盖公有解析和内部服务域名</li>\n<li><strong>DNS Resolver</strong>：负责递归解析的 DNS 代理，支持条件转发将特定域名查询路由到指定 DNS 服务器</li>\n<li><strong>Split-Horizon DNS</strong>：同一域名根据查询来源返回不同 IP 的架构模式，实现内外流量路径分离</li>\n<li><strong>DNSSEC</strong>：DNS 安全扩展，通过数字签名验证 DNS 响应的真实性，防止缓存投毒攻击</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"云原生-dns-服务对比\">云原生 DNS 服务对比</h2><p>三大云平台各自提供了托管 DNS 服务，核心能力对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>AWS Route 53</th>\n<th>Azure DNS</th>\n<th>GCP Cloud DNS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公有托管区</td>\n<td>Hosted Zone</td>\n<td>DNS Zone</td>\n<td>Managed Zone (Public)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有托管区</td>\n<td>Private Hosted Zone</td>\n<td>Private DNS Zone</td>\n<td>Managed Zone (Private)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析器</td>\n<td>Route 53 Resolver</td>\n<td>Private Resolver</td>\n<td>Cloud DNS Server Policy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNSSEC 签名</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询日志</td>\n<td>Query Logging → CloudWatch</td>\n<td>Diagnostic Logs</td>\n<td>DNS Logging → Cloud Logging</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLA</td>\n<td>100% 可用性</td>\n<td>100% 可用性</td>\n<td>100% 可用性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价模型</td>\n<td>每 Zone <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>月</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>每百万查询</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.50/月 + 每百万查询</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每百万查询</span></span></span></span></span>0.40</td>\n<td>每 Zone $0.50/月 + 超量查询费</td>\n<td>每 Zone <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>月</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>每百万查询</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20/月 + 每百万查询</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每百万查询</span></span></span></span></span>0.40</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三家的 DNS SLA 都是 100%——这在云服务中极为罕见，反映了 DNS 作为基础设施核心的不可替代性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vpc-内部-dns-解析\">VPC 内部 DNS 解析</h2><p>每个 VPC 都有一个内置的 DNS 解析器（AWS 中称为 AmazonProvidedDNS，地址为 VPC CIDR 的第二个 IP，例如 <code>10.0.0.2</code>）。它自动解析以下域名：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    Instance[EC2 Instance] --&gt;|DNS Query| Resolver[VPC DNS Resolver&lt;br/&gt;10.0.0.2]&#10;    Resolver --&gt;|&quot;*.compute.internal&quot;| Internal[VPC 内部主机名]&#10;    Resolver --&gt;|&quot;*.amazonaws.com&quot;| AWSService[AWS 服务端点]&#10;    Resolver --&gt;|Private Hosted Zone| PHZ[Route 53 私有托管区]&#10;    Resolver --&gt;|其他域名| Public[公有 DNS 递归解析]\">graph TB\n    Instance[EC2 Instance] --&gt;|DNS Query| Resolver[VPC DNS Resolver&lt;br/&gt;10.0.0.2]\n    Resolver --&gt;|\"*.compute.internal\"| Internal[VPC 内部主机名]\n    Resolver --&gt;|\"*.amazonaws.com\"| AWSService[AWS 服务端点]\n    Resolver --&gt;|Private Hosted Zone| PHZ[Route 53 私有托管区]\n    Resolver --&gt;|其他域名| Public[公有 DNS 递归解析]</pre><p>**Private Hosted Zone（PHZ）**是 VPC 内部 DNS 的核心工具。它允许为任意域名创建私有解析记录，仅对关联的 VPC 可见。典型使用场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内部服务域名：<code>api.internal.company.com → 10.1.2.100</code></li>\n<li>数据库连接：<code>db-primary.internal → RDS Endpoint CNAME</code></li>\n<li>覆盖公有解析：将 <code>s3.amazonaws.com</code> 指向 VPC 端点 IP</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个 PHZ 可以关联到多个 VPC（包括跨账户），实现统一的内部域名管理。跨账户关联需要通过 RAM 或 CLI 授权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"split-horizon-dns\">Split-Horizon DNS</h2><p>Split-Horizon（分裂视图）DNS 是企业混合环境中的常见模式：同一个域名根据查询来源返回不同的解析结果。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>query</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>10.1.2.100 (私有 IP)</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if source</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mtext>VPC</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>203.0.113.50 (公有 IP)</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if source</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Internet</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{query}(api.company.com) = \\begin{cases} \\text{10.1.2.100 (私有 IP)} &amp; \\text{if source} \\in \\text{VPC} \\\\ \\text{203.0.113.50 (公有 IP)} &amp; \\text{if source} \\in \\text{Internet} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">query</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10.1.2.100 (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">私有</span><span class=\"mord\"> IP)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">203.0.113.50 (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">公有</span><span class=\"mord\"> IP)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if source</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VPC</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if source</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Internet</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实现方式：在 Route 53 中为同一域名创建公有 Hosted Zone（解析到 ALB 公有 IP）和私有 Hosted Zone（解析到内部 IP 或 PrivateLink 端点）。VPC 中的查询优先匹配 PHZ——如果匹配到记录就返回，不会再查公有 Zone。</p>\n<p>这种模式的好处是：VPC 内部的服务间通信走私有网络路径（低延迟、无数据传输费），而外部用户仍然通过公有端点进入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dns-解析器与条件转发\">DNS 解析器与条件转发</h2><p>对于多 VPC 和混合环境，单个 VPC 的内置解析器不够——需要集中式 DNS 解析器来处理跨域查询。</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Route 53 Resolver</strong>：部署在 VPC 中的托管 DNS 代理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>部署</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Inbound Endpoint</td>\n<td>接收来自本地/其他 VPC 的 DNS 查询</td>\n<td>2+ AZ，每 AZ 1 ENI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Outbound Endpoint</td>\n<td>将特定域名查询转发到本地/外部 DNS</td>\n<td>2+ AZ，每 AZ 1 ENI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Resolver Rule</td>\n<td>定义转发条件（域名 → 目标 IP）</td>\n<td>可通过 RAM 跨账户共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>条件转发规则的评估顺序：最长域名后缀匹配。例如 <code>db.corp.internal</code> 的查询会优先匹配 <code>corp.internal</code> 规则而非 <code>internal</code> 规则。</p>\n<p><strong>Azure Private Resolver</strong>：2023 年 GA 的托管服务，提供 Inbound / Outbound Endpoint 和 DNS Forwarding Ruleset。与 Route 53 Resolver 功能对等，但集成在 VNet 中而非独立服务。</p>\n<p><strong>GCP Cloud DNS Server Policy</strong>：通过 Inbound / Outbound 策略实现类似功能。GCP 独特的 DNS Peering 特性允许一个 VPC 的 DNS 查询委派到另一个 VPC 的 Private Zone——无需部署中间转发器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dnssec-与-dns-安全\">DNSSEC 与 DNS 安全</h2><p>DNS 报文本身不加密、不认证——这使得 DNS 欺骗（cache poisoning）和中间人攻击成为可能。DNSSEC 通过对 DNS 记录进行数字签名来验证响应的真实性。</p>\n<p>DNSSEC 签名链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Root</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>.com</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>company.com</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>A Record</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Root} \\xrightarrow{DS} \\text{.com} \\xrightarrow{DS} \\text{company.com} \\xrightarrow{RRSIG} \\text{A Record}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Root</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">.com</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2948em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">company.com</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A Record</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 AWS 中启用 DNSSEC 签名需要：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 KMS 中创建非对称签名密钥（ECC_NIST_P256）</li>\n<li>在 Route 53 中为 Hosted Zone 启用 DNSSEC 签名</li>\n<li>向上级域（registrar）提交 DS 记录建立信任链</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Route 53 Resolver 默认启用 DNSSEC 验证——如果收到的 DNS 响应签名无效，会返回 SERVFAIL 而非伪造的记录。</p>\n<p><strong>DNS Firewall</strong>：AWS Route 53 Resolver DNS Firewall 允许基于域名黑白名单过滤 DNS 查询。它可以阻止 VPC 中的实例解析已知恶意域名（如 C2 服务器），是网络层安全的第一道防线。GCP Cloud NGFW 同样支持基于 FQDN 的 DNS 防火墙规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"服务发现集成\">服务发现集成</h2><p>现代微服务架构需要动态的服务发现——新实例上线时自动注册 DNS 记录，下线时自动注销。</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Cloud Map</strong>：提供 HTTP 和 DNS 两种服务发现机制。DNS 模式下，服务实例注册为 SRV 或 A 记录，ECS 和 App Runner 原生集成。</p>\n<p><strong>Kubernetes CoreDNS</strong>：EKS/AKS/GKE 集群内部使用 CoreDNS 提供 Pod 和 Service 的 DNS 解析。Service 域名格式为 <code>&lt;service&gt;.&lt;namespace&gt;.svc.cluster.local</code>。CoreDNS 可以配置条件转发，将非集群域名的查询代理到 VPC DNS 解析器。</p>\n<p>如何利用 DNS 实现全球智能路由决策，参见 <a href=\"global-traffic-management\">全球流量管理</a>。关于负载均衡器如何在 DNS 解析后进一步分发流量，参见 <a href=\"load-balancer-patterns\">负载均衡器模式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>云 DNS 架构的设计要点：用 Private Hosted Zone 实现 VPC 内部服务域名管理和 Split-Horizon 流量分离；用 Resolver Endpoint + 条件转发解决混合环境的跨域解析；用 DNSSEC 签名保护域名真实性；用 DNS Firewall 阻断恶意域名解析。DNS 是所有上层服务（负载均衡、全球路由、服务发现）的基础——它的故障影响面通常比计算层更广。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"云 DNS 架构","id":"云-dns-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"云原生 DNS 服务对比","id":"云原生-dns-服务对比"},{"level":2,"text":"VPC 内部 DNS 解析","id":"vpc-内部-dns-解析"},{"level":2,"text":"Split-Horizon DNS","id":"split-horizon-dns"},{"level":2,"text":"DNS 解析器与条件转发","id":"dns-解析器与条件转发"},{"level":2,"text":"DNSSEC 与 DNS 安全","id":"dnssec-与-dns-安全"},{"level":2,"text":"服务发现集成","id":"服务发现集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混合云 VPN 与专线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/hybrid-cloud-vpn-directconnect"},"next":{"title":"负载均衡器模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/load-balancer-patterns"}}